	"Description": "我很抱歉。\n<br />I'm so sorry.\n<br />\n<br />我的英语并不好。\n<br />My English is not very good.\n<br />\n<br />所以英语翻译都是机翻。\n<br />So all English translations are machine-translated.\n<br />\n<br />这是我第一次作图，做的很大浪费了我很多时间，但我很有成就感。\n<br />This was my first time doing a drawing. I made it very large, which wasted a lot of my time. But after finishing it, I felt a great sense of achievement.\n<br />\n<br />如果你喜欢我的地图，是我的荣幸。\n<br />If you like my map, it's my pleasure.\n<br />\n<br />地图默认替换海滩农场，可以通过GMCM替换其他农场。\n<br />The map will default to replacing the beach farm. Other farms can be replaced through GMCM.\n<br />\n<br />火山洞穴会每天刷新一些姜岛物品、矿石和火山晶石。\n<br />The volcanic cave will replenish some Jiaoluo items, minerals and volcanic crystals every day.\n<br />\n<br />沙漠洞穴会每天刷新一些沙漠物品、矿石和放射性矿石。\n<br />The desert caves will replenish some desert items, minerals and radioactive ores every day.\n<br />\n<br />林场预先有一些树木，你可以放树液采集器也可以只当做伐木场。\n<br />The forest already had some trees before. You can install tree sap collectors or just use it as a logging site.\n<br />\n<br />船骸内部有一个温室。\n<br />Inside the wreck of the ship, there is a greenhouse.",
